      {
        "Id": "961eab41a8a806b2f555c45fc4b27c6a",
        "Title": "Describe the field",
        "DescriptionText": "Places elements by row and column, each wrapped in a Layout.Cell. columns is a Dynamo-style width list: \"*,*\" splits the space evenly, \"auto,*\" sizes the first to its content.",
